{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Explore through the universe </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new universe every run. Use the time between alien waves to harvest resources from nearby planets and prepare for the next fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.poster.avif?t=1760808367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.webm?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.mp4?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight colorful waves of aliens </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter diverse alien species as you explore the universe. Master your movement, shooting, and skills to overcome waves that grow stronger each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.poster.avif?t=1760808367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.webm?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.mp4?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build your way to victory </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spaceship and combine artifacts, talents, and items to forge unique builds. Experiment with countless synergies and unleash your own playstyle in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.poster.avif?t=1760808367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.webm?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.mp4?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.poster.avif?t=1760808367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.webm?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.mp4?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11bf0d780ebd4195df74cfe8f3850003.poster.avif?t=1760808367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11bf0d780ebd4195df74cfe8f3850003.webm?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11bf0d780ebd4195df74cfe8f3850003.mp4?t=1760808367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Endless replayability</strong>: A dynamically generated universe that offers limitless exploration with planets, stars, black holes, aliens, and wonders to discover, setting it apart from traditional static or repetitive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless builds</strong>: Hundreds of different abilities obtainable through talents, items, artifacts (and more) that can completely shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Between alien waves, harvest resources from nearby planets and interact with the universe to prepare your next move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Quick play sessions:</strong>\u00a0Play in short bursts and pick up right where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>And more:\u00a0</strong>Missions, unlockables, and surprises await.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352670?t=1760808367","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352670?t=1760808367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/8500579191ee1678b9b6d0a1f7630592d15b002a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760808367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/8500579191ee1678b9b6d0a1f7630592d15b002a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760808367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","i